WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.488
Hi, I'm Peter.

2
00:00:08.489 --> 00:00:10.530
I'm in the second grade.

3
00:00:10.531 --> 00:00:13.831
I have one thing to say:

4
00:00:13.832 --> 00:00:16.906
It's not easy being a kid!

5
00:00:16.907 --> 00:00:24.091
Being a kid might look like fun, but sometimes it's not.

6
00:00:24.092 --> 00:00:28.003
Yesterday, I was playing outside with my friend.

7
00:00:28.004 --> 00:00:33.172
I was having a really good time.

8
00:00:33.173 --> 00:00:39.163
Then suddenly my mother said, "Peter, it's time to come inside now.

9
00:00:39.164 --> 00:00:41.398
It's getting dark."

10
00:00:41.399 --> 00:00:49.653
When you're an adult, no one can tell you what to do or when to do it.

11
00:00:49.654 --> 00:00:56.091
When you're a kid, you have to get up early in the morning and go to school.

12
00:00:56.092 --> 00:01:03.993
At school you have to study math, English, science, and history.

13
00:01:03.994 --> 00:01:07.689
After school, you have to do your homework.

14
00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:16.887
When you're an adult, you do not have to go to school and you never have homework.

15
00:01:16.888 --> 00:01:21.339
When you're a kid, there are many things you can't watch.

16
00:01:21.340 --> 00:01:25.782
Last Saturday there was a scary movie on TV.

17
00:01:25.783 --> 00:01:29.988
It looked really exciting.

18
00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:33.236
But my father would not let me watch.

19
00:01:33.237 --> 00:01:37.133
He said, "You're too young for this movie, Peter."

20
00:01:37.134 --> 00:01:44.171
When you're an adult, you can watch anything you want.

21
00:01:44.172 --> 00:01:49.046
When you're a kid, the older kids sometimes pick on you.

22
00:01:49.047 --> 00:01:57.395
When I was walking home from school on Monday, Tom and Steve bothered me.

23
00:01:57.396 --> 00:02:01.278
Steve took my schoolbag and put it in a tree.

24
00:02:01.279 --> 00:02:03.519
It made me very mad.

25
00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:09.861
When you're an adult, no one can pick on you.

26
00:02:09.862 --> 00:02:14.844
When you're a kid, you can't go anywhere by yourself.

27
00:02:14.845 --> 00:02:20.154
Last Friday, I wanted to buy a birthday gift for my friend John.

28
00:02:20.155 --> 00:02:26.714
But I had to wait for my mom to return home.

29
00:02:26.715 --> 00:02:33.664
When I want to go somewhere, I have to ride my bike or ask my mom for a ride.

30
00:02:33.665 --> 00:02:41.460
When you're an adult, you can drive a car wherever you want.

31
00:02:41.461 --> 00:02:45.708
When you're a kid, you have to go to bed early.

32
00:02:45.709 --> 00:02:52.634
On school nights, my mom makes me go to bed at 9:00.

33
00:02:52.635 --> 00:02:58.559
But I do have a mom and dad who love me, which is really great.

34
00:02:58.560 --> 00:03:08.045
So I guess I like being a kid, even though—it's not easy being a kid!
